===Etymology===
From {{inh|fo|non|biðja}}, from {{inh|fo|gem-pro|*bidjaną}}. Cognate with {{cog|de|bitten}}, {{cog|is|biðja}}, {{cog|da|bede}}, {{cog|sv|bedja}}, {{cog|en|bede}}, {{m|en|bead}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|fo|/ˈpiːja/}}
*: {{rhymes|fo|iːja}}

===Verb===
{{fo-verb|bað|bóðu|biðið}}

# to [[ask]], to [[request]], to [[beg]]
# to [[wish]] (e.g. ''[[góðan dag]]'' - good day)
# to [[pray]] to God (''[[Gud]]'')

